OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start this morning with
OL,6,Fsome early sunshine. Cloud will build
OL,7,Fthroughout the morning, with outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain spreading southwards during
OL,9,Fthe middle of the day. Skies then
OL,10,Fturning brighter again later.
OL,11,FTemperatures a little below average
OL,12,Ffor August.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FLargely dry this evening and
OL,15,Fovernight, but a few showers may move
OL,16,Falong the east coast at times.
OL,17,FClearing skies will lead to a chilly
OL,18,Fnight, especially in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
