OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright day with a
OL,6,Fmix of sunny spells and fair weather
OL,7,Fcloud. After a cool start,
OL,8,Ftemperatures climbing to around
OL,9,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FRemaining dry with sunny spells on
OL,13,FSunday and Monday. Showers and
OL,14,Fpossibly thunderstorms then moving in
OL,15,Ffrom the west on Tuesday. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarmer, especially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
